          <span class="stat-number" data-target="4">0</span>
          <span class="stat-label">User Role Types in HRMS</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card animate-on-scroll" style="transition-delay:0.2s">
          <span class="stat-number" data-target="100" data-suffix="%">0</span>
          <span class="stat-label">RTL Coverage &mdash; Consumer App</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card animate-on-scroll" style="transition-delay:0.3s">
          <span class="stat-number" data-target="2">0</span>
          <span class="stat-label">App Stores Submitted</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== ABOUT ===== -->
  <section id="about">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-label animate-on-scroll">WHO I AM</div>
      <h2 class="section-heading animate-on-scroll" style="transition-delay:0.1s">A builder who ships. Every sprint, every week.</h2>
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-text animate-on-scroll" style="transition-delay:0.2s">
          <p>
            I joined SpeedForce Digital as an AI Engineer and grew rapidly into a
            full-stack mobile and web contributor &mdash; owning everything from
            enterprise HR system architecture to pixel-perfect Flutter app redesigns,
            Arabic RTL localization, live GPS tracking, and cloud function deployment.
          </p>
          <p>
            My work spans five production-grade projects delivered across web and
            mobile platforms &mdash; each one shipped, tested, and actively used. I don&rsquo;t
            just write code; I take ownership of the full delivery cycle from first
            commit to App Store submission.
          </p>
          <ul class="about-highlights">
            <li>Tallu Consumer App &mdash; iOS &amp; Android (Flutter)</li>
            <li>Tallu Provider/Supplier App &mdash; iOS &amp; Android (Flutter)</li>
            <li>HRMS System &mdash; Full-stack HR platform (React + TypeScript + Appwrite)</li>
            <li>United Force &mdash; Saudi Arabia B2B landing page</li>
            <li>Qaider App &mdash; Onboarding, architecture audit &amp; redesign</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="about-code-card animate-on-scroll" style="transition-delay:0.3s">
          <span class="code-comment">// HRMS &mdash; Real-time Performance Engine</span><br>
          <span class="code-keyword">class</span> <span class="code-class">PerformanceService</span> {<br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="code-keyword">Future</span>&lt;<span class="code-keyword">void</span>&gt; recalculate(<span class="code-keyword">String</span> employeeId) <span class="code-keyword">async</span> {<br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="code-keyword">final</span> attendance = <span class="code-keyword">await</span> _fetchAttendance(employeeId);<br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="code-keyword">final</span> tasks = <span class="code-keyword">await</span> _fetchTasks(employeeId);<br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="code-keyword">final</span> score = _computeScore(attendance, tasks);<br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="code-keyword">await</span> _updateMetrics(employeeId, score);<br>
          &nbsp;&nbsp;}<br>
          }
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== PROJECTS ===== -->
  <section id="projects">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-label animate-on-scroll">WHAT I BUILT</div>
      <h2 class="section-heading animate-on-scroll" style="transition-delay:0.1s">6 projects. Real users. Shipped.</h2>

      <!-- Tallu Consumer -->
      <div class="project-card-large animate-on-scroll" style="transition-delay:0.2s">
        <div class="project-image">
          <img src="https://tallu.speedforcehosting.com/_next/image?url=%2FHome%20screens%2FMockup.png&w=3840&q=75" alt="Tallu Consumer App Mockup" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="project-content">
          <div class="project-tag">Flutter &middot; iOS &amp; Android</div>
          <h3 class="project-title">Tallu Consumer App</h3>
          <div class="project-subhead">On-demand marketplace for Saudi Arabia</div>
          <p class="project-desc">
            Built the complete consumer-facing mobile app &mdash; enabling users across
            Saudi Arabia to book construction machinery, freight transport, and
            24/7 roadside assistance. Includes live GPS tracking, real-time offer
            negotiation, full Arabic/RTL UI, push notification routing, KYC flows,
            reports module, and collapsible tracking bottom sheets.
          </p>
          <div class="project-features">
            <span class="feature-pill">Live GPS Tracking</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">RTL/Arabic</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">FCM Notifications</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Draggable Sheets</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Real-time Offers</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Reports Module</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">1,000+ Locale Keys</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Appwrite Real-time</span>
          </div>
          <div class="project-stats-row">
            <span>200+ Screens</span>
            <span>iOS &amp; Android</span>
            <span>TestFlight Released</span>
          </div>
          <a href="https://tallu.speedforcehosting.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="project-link">
            View Landing Page
            <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tallu Provider -->
      <div class="project-card-large reversed animate-on-scroll" style="transition-delay:0.3s">
        <div class="project-content">
          <div class="project-tag">Flutter &middot; iOS &amp; Android</div>
          <h3 class="project-title">Tallu Provider App</h3>
          <div class="project-subhead">Supplier-side app for verified service providers</div>
          <p class="project-desc">
            Built the full provider-facing mobile app &mdash; from two-step KYC
            submission and complete profile flow to live job tracking, machinery
            and vehicle management, commission wallet with top-up requests,
            custom vehicle types, nearby machinery map with private request flow,
            and targeted push notifications based on provider inventory.
          </p>
          <div class="project-features">
            <span class="feature-pill">Commission Wallet</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Live GPS</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">KYC Verification</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Custom Vehicle Types</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Nearby Machinery Map</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Private Requests</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">RTL Support</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">TestFlight Released</span>
          </div>
          <div class="project-stats-row">
            <span>150+ Screens</span>
            <span>7 Cloud Functions</span>
            <span>Appwrite Real-time</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-image">
          <img src="https://tallu.speedforcehosting.com/_next/image?url=%2FHome%20screens%2FMockup.png&w=3840&q=75" alt="Tallu Provider App Mockup" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tallu Admin Panel -->
      <div class="project-card-large animate-on-scroll" style="transition-delay:0.35s">
        <div class="project-image">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1460925895917-afdab827c52f?w=800&q=80" alt="Tallu Admin Panel" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="project-content">
          <div class="project-tag">React &middot; TypeScript &middot; Appwrite</div>
          <h3 class="project-title">Tallu Admin Panel</h3>
          <div class="project-subhead">Centralized operations dashboard for the Tallu platform</div>
          <p class="project-desc">
            Built and maintained the complete admin control panel for the Tallu ecosystem &mdash;
            a feature-rich dashboard enabling platform-wide user management, service verification,
            order tracking, content moderation, and real-time analytics. Integrated with the same
            Appwrite backend powering both Consumer and Provider apps for seamless data consistency
            across the entire Tallu platform.
          </p>
          <div class="project-features">
            <span class="feature-pill">User Management</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Order Tracking</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Service Verification</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Content Moderation</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Real-time Analytics</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Appwrite Backend</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Reports Module</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Role-Based Access</span>
          </div>
          <div class="project-stats-row">
            <span>Full Dashboard</span>
            <span>Cross-App Integration</span>
          </div>
          <a href="https://tallu-admin.speedforcehosting.com/dashboard" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="project-link">
            View Dashboard
            <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Small cards -->
      <div class="project-cards-small">
        <!-- HRMS -->
        <div class="project-card-small animate-on-scroll" style="transition-delay:0.1s">
          <div class="project-image-small" style="background:var(--color-navy-mid);overflow:hidden">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551288049-bebda4e38f71?w=600&q=80" alt="HRMS System Dashboard" loading="lazy"
              style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
          </div>
          <div class="project-tag">React &middot; TypeScript &middot; Appwrite</div>
          <h3 class="project-title" style="font-size:20px;margin:10px 0 4px">HRMS System</h3>
          <div class="project-subhead" style="font-size:14px;margin-bottom:12px">Enterprise HR platform built from scratch</div>
          <p class="project-desc" style="font-size:13px">
            Architected and built a full Human Resource Management System &mdash;
            covering employee attendance with clock-in/out and break tracking, multi-stage
            leave management (Employee &rarr; Team Lead &rarr; HR), role-based dashboards
            for 4 user types, performance analytics, and strict governance (20 leave/year
            quota, 2/month cap). Migrated the backend to Neon DB with Prisma (24 tables),
            deployed to Vercel serverless, and optimized the API from 124K+ requests down
            by 95% by eliminating memory leaks and correcting polling intervals.
          </p>
          <div class="project-features">
            <span class="feature-pill">Role-Based Auth</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Attendance Tracking</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Leave Governance</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Performance Analytics</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Neon DB + Prisma</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Vercel Deployed</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Data Export</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Enterprise Dashboards</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">95% API Reduction</span>
          </div>
          <div class="project-stats-row" style="margin-top:8px">
            <span>4 User Roles</span>
            <span>24 DB Tables</span>
            <span>95% API Reduction</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- United Force -->
        <div class="project-card-small animate-on-scroll" style="transition-delay:0.2s">
          <div class="project-image-small" style="overflow:hidden">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581091226825-a6a2a5aee158?w=600&q=80" alt="United Force" loading="lazy"
              style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
          </div>
          <div class="project-tag">Web &middot; HTML/CSS/JS</div>
          <h3 class="project-title" style="font-size:20px;margin:10px 0 4px">United Force</h3>
          <div class="project-subhead" style="font-size:14px;margin-bottom:12px">Saudi Arabia B2B industrial landing page</div>
          <p class="project-desc" style="font-size:13px">
            Designed and developed the complete United Force landing page &mdash;
            a Saudi Arabia&ndash;based B2B industrial services website. Built with a
            consistent brand design system, catalog browse flow, quote request
            form, and WhatsApp contact integration. Delivered with optimized
            loading performance, full testing, version control, and documentation.
          </p>
          <div class="project-features">
            <span class="feature-pill">Design System</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Lead Generation</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">WhatsApp CTA</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Catalog Form</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Performance Optimized</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">SEO Ready</span>
          </div>
          <a href="https://unitedforce.sa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="project-link" style="margin-top:12px;display:inline-flex">
            View Live
            <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px"></i>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Qaider -->
        <div class="project-card-small animate-on-scroll" style="transition-delay:0.3s">
          <div class="project-image-small" style="background:var(--color-navy-mid);overflow:hidden">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512941937669-90a1b58e7e9c?w=600&q=80" alt="Qaider App" loading="lazy"
              style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
          </div>
          <div class="project-tag">Flutter &middot; In Progress</div>
          <h3 class="project-title" style="font-size:20px;margin:10px 0 4px">Qaider App</h3>
          <div class="project-subhead" style="font-size:14px;margin-bottom:12px">Google Business Profile management &mdash; onboarding &amp; audit</div>
          <p class="project-desc" style="font-size:13px">
